menu "Boopie"

    config BOOPIE_OTA_URL
        string "OTA server (its /v1, no trailing slash)"
        default ""
        help
            Where the board looks for updates, e.g.
            https://boopie-ota.<subdomain>.workers.dev/v1 (cloud/ota-worker).
            The release workflow sets it; empty turns updates off.

    config BOOPIE_OTA_PUBKEY
        string "OTA public key (P-256 point, 130 hex digits)"
        default ""
        help
            The uncompressed public key (04 || X || Y) of the release key that
            signs each update's manifest. The release workflow works it out
            from the BOOPIE_OTA_KEY secret; empty turns updates off.

endmenu
